```

## Use when

FAQ, pricing tables, three-up value props.

## Avoid when

Busy imagery-led layouts, where the rules fight the pictures.

## Pairs with

Numbered sections, Hard edges, flat depth

Measured on: Preference Model, Hone, Jog.

Rules: Rebuild from these measurements, never from a real site's code, text, logos or imagery. A font in <angle brackets> is a placeholder: pick a licensed face of that kind. Respect prefers-reduced-motion.
